      "headline": "UK breakthrough",
      "supportingCopy": "The song appears on the album \"Spiceworld\" (1997). \"Too Much\" is a song by English girl group the Spice Girls from their second studio album, Spiceworld (1997). Released as the album's second single on 8 December 1997, it topped the UK Singles Chart for two weeks, becoming the group's second consecutive Christmas number-one single, and their sixth consecutive chart-topper, which made them the first act to have its first six singles reach number one in the United Kingdom. Spiceworld is the second studio album by English girl group the Spice Girls, released on 1 November 1997 by Virgin Records. The album became a commercial success worldwide, lengthening the so-called \"Spicemania\" of the time. Artist: Spice Girls · Title: Too Much · Album: Too Much · Year: 1997 · Genre: Pop · PlayCount: 1 · Path: MEDIA/VIDEO/1990's/Spice Girls - Too",
